#{[{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186059750 :knowledge-point/canonical-example {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186059559 :question/id #uuid "043a5e58-e1a0-50a5-b1be-d404e6262991" :question/math-academy-id "e-4436" :question/problem "If\n$$\n\\displaystyle {A} = \n    \\left\\lbrack\n    \\begin{matrix}\n        2 & -1  \\\\\n        -3 & k\n    \\end{matrix}\n    \\right\\rbrack\n$$\nand\n$\\det({A}) = 5$, what is the value of $k?$" :question/worked-solution "For a $2 \\times 2$ matrix, the determinant is given by the formula\n\n$$\n\\begin{vmatrix}a & b \\\\ c & d\\end{vmatrix} = ad - bc.\n$$\n\nUsing the formula, we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(A) & =\\begin{vmatrix}2 & -1 \\\\ -3 & k\\end{vmatrix} \\\\  & =2\\cdot k-(-1)\\cdot (-3) \\\\  & =2k-3\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $\\det(A)=5,$ we obtain:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(A) & =5 \\\\ 2k-3 & =5 \\\\ 2k & =8 \\\\ k & =4\\end{aligned}\n$$"} :knowledge-point/id #uuid "4ccdde46-a4ab-517e-910b-571a3a166b6a" :knowledge-point/key-prerequisites [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186048673 :topic/id #uuid "b3c9ca33-97a8-546e-af44-a9a7a7a71eb5" :topic/knowledge-points [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186054654} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186054655} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186054656} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186054657}] :topic/math-academy-id 66 :topic/next [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186048267} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186048714} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186049044} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186049200} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186049944} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186050097} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186050347} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186050503} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186050511} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186050532}] :topic/title "Solving Two-Step Equations"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186049026 :topic/id #uuid "d49a6c77-a56c-5955-b68f-69307587aa23" :topic/knowledge-points [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186064325} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186064326} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186064327}] :topic/math-academy-id 352 :topic/next [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186049044} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186049074} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186050372}